Backport of php-src b11bd1d9390bb203684e3d4aa5e1104ea842de6f (PHP-8.2) to PHP 7.2:
- redirect path: url components are char* in 7.2, emalloc() -> safe_emalloc() instead of zend_string_safe_alloc()
- zend_string_efree() -> zend_string_free(), false -> 0
- len_size int -> size_t and len_read int -> ssize_t (as in 7.4+), required now that buf_size is unsigned
- test: includes follow-up 3aedde06bc (lean streaming server); --EXTENSIONS--/--CONFLICTS-- dropped, http_server_skipif() takes a socket in 7.2, one_way shown as 0 in the 7.2 trace
